HR Orchestrator LoRA Adapter
Copyright 2026 the HR Orchestrator project contributors

This distribution contains a LoRA adapter produced by modifying model behavior
through QLoRA fine-tuning. The adapter was created from
unsloth/gemma-4-E2B-it-unsloth-bnb-4bit, which is derived from
google/gemma-4-E2B-it by Google DeepMind.

The adapter was tested for inference with
cyankiwi/gemma-4-E2B-it-AWQ-INT4. The upstream base-model and quantized-model
weights are not included in this adapter repository.

